  ph: [["Settle symptoms",0,2,"Reduce neck/arm pain and restore comfortable movement.","pain settling, arm symptoms reducing, sleeping better","Avoid collars and prolonged rest. Keep gentle movement going; avoid sustained end-range positions."],["Restore range & deep neck flexors",2,5,"Regain range and activate the deep neck flexors.","near-full range, comfortable with daily activity, arm symptoms centralising","Progress gently — brief symptom increases that settle are OK."],["Strengthening & posture endurance",5,9,"Build neck/scapular strength and endurance.","tolerating desk work and daily loads, minimal symptoms","Address workstation setup and take regular movement breaks."],["Return to full activity",9,12,"Restore full capacity for work and sport.","confident with your activities, symptoms settled","Progressive weakness or worsening arm symptoms should be reviewed."]]
